---
title: Thumbnail series
description: Eight series, eight sets of fixed parts. A series is recognisable before anyone reads it because the same things sit in the same places every week — only the photo and the word change.
eyebrow: Concept · Thumbnails
source: src/components/poster.css
---
<p>A type answers <em>what kind of video is this?</em> A series answers <em>which show is this?</em> — and the answer has to arrive faster than the title. So each series below fixes three things and leaves the rest free:</p>
<ul>
	<li><b>The type</b> — never changes inside a series.</li>
	<li><b>The chip</b> — same position, same pattern of words (<code>day 12 · lisbon</code>, never sometimes "day twelve").</li>
	<li><b>One signature</b> — a red line, a pixel episode number, a hand note, a sticker. One. Two signatures is a collage.</li>
</ul>
<p>Everything else — the photo, the word, the note — is the episode. Three thumbnails per series below, so you can see what stays and what moves.</p>

<h2 id="daily">Daily vlog</h2>
{{#example code=false}}
<div class="im-grid-auto im-grid-md">
	<figure class="im-poster im-poster-face">
		<img class="im-poster-subject im-poster-card" src="/assets/photos/face-golden-hour.jpg" alt="">
		<span class="im-poster-chip">day 12 · lisbon</span>
		<strong class="im-poster-word">slow<br>sunday<i class="im-poster-dot"></i></strong>
		<span class="im-poster-hand">no plans. perfect.</span>
		<span class="im-poster-time">14:08</span>
	</figure>
	<figure class="im-poster im-poster-face">
		<img class="im-poster-subject im-poster-card" src="/assets/photos/person-coat.jpg" alt="" style="--im-poster-focus: 40% 30%">
		<span class="im-poster-chip">day 13 · lisbon</span>
		<strong class="im-poster-word">got<br>lost<i class="im-poster-dot"></i></strong>
		<span class="im-poster-hand">on purpose (mostly)</span>
		<span class="im-poster-time">11:52</span>
	</figure>
	<figure class="im-poster im-poster-face">
		<img class="im-poster-subject im-poster-card" src="/assets/photos/coffee-brew.jpg" alt="">
		<span class="im-poster-chip">day 14 · lisbon</span>
		<strong class="im-poster-word">coffee<br>nerd<i class="im-poster-dot"></i></strong>
		<span class="im-poster-hand">3 cafés before noon</span>
		<span class="im-poster-time">09:31</span>
	</figure>
</div>
{{/example}}
<p><b>Type:</b> Face + word. <b>Chip:</b> <code>day N · city</code>, top left. <b>Signature:</b> the hand note under the word — it is the vlog's voice, so write it the way you would text a friend. The word is a feeling, two short lines, never the activity ("slow sunday", not "exploring the old town").</p>

