<p><b>Type:</b> Place. <b>Chip:</b> <code>ep N · country</code>, paper, top left. <b>Signature:</b> the white strip with the red line. Pick photos with a high horizon so nothing worth seeing hides under the strip. The word is the one thing you would tell someone about the place, not its name — the chip already has the name.</p>

<h2 id="qna">Q&amp;A</h2>
{{#example code=false}}
<div class="im-grid-auto im-grid-md">
	<figure class="im-poster im-poster-ask">
		<img class="im-poster-subject im-poster-card" src="/assets/photos/person-reading.jpg" alt="">
		<strong class="im-poster-word">your<br>questions<i class="im-poster-dot"></i></strong>
		<span class="im-poster-glyph">{{icon "circle-help"}}</span>
		<span class="im-poster-hand">round 4</span>
		<span class="im-poster-time">31:00</span>
	</figure>
	<figure class="im-poster im-poster-ask">
		<img class="im-poster-subject im-poster-card" src="/assets/photos/face-sunglasses.jpg" alt="">
		<strong class="im-poster-word">money<br>talk<i class="im-poster-dot"></i></strong>
		<span class="im-poster-glyph">{{icon "circle-help"}}</span>
		<span class="im-poster-hand">you asked, so…</span>
		<span class="im-poster-time">24:16</span>
	</figure>
	<figure class="im-poster im-poster-ask">
		<img class="im-poster-subject im-poster-card" src="/assets/photos/person-backpack.jpg" alt="">
		<strong class="im-poster-word">why I<br>left<i class="im-poster-dot"></i></strong>
		<span class="im-poster-glyph">{{icon "circle-help"}}</span>
		<span class="im-poster-hand">the honest version</span>
		<span class="im-poster-time">18:40</span>
	</figure>
</div>
{{/example}}
<p><b>Type:</b> Question. <b>Signature:</b> the drawn question mark, always the same size and spot. <b>Hand note:</b> the round number or a one-line tease. Never write a viewer's question in full on the thumbnail — the topic in two words, the question in the title.</p>

