	</figure>
</div>
{{/example}}
<p><b>Type:</b> Icon for a course (the lesson is a topic in a series), Screen + face for a one-off how-to. <b>Signature:</b> the <code>01/12</code> progress in pixel type — it tells a returning viewer exactly where they are.</p>

